am_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024830-1846018067925239","game_id":"steam-5024830","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.2.1 Hotfix Patch Notes","summary":"Hello, soon-to-be quitters! Hotfix update v0.2.1 is now live, bringing improvements for various screen resolutions. Please check below for the full patch details. Patch DetailsSupport for Multiple Aspect Ratios Letterboxing has been implemented for non-16:9 resolutions such as 16:10 and 21:9 to prevent screen distortion or UI cutoff.Low-Resolution Optimization Fixed an issue where UI elements spilled off-screen on older laptops and lower displays such as 1366x768.Thank you so much to everyone pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T07:23:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925239","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024830-1845383656396620","game_id":"steam-5024830","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.2.0 Patch Notes: System Improvements & Content Expansion","summary":"Hello, soon-to-be quitters!We have released the v0.2.0 update for One Week Left : Last Days at the Office, featuring core system improvements and expanded content. This update brings several enhancements designed to immerse you even deeper into daily office life.Key UpdatesCore Metrics Gauge UI Added A gauge UI has been added to let you track the three pillars of office life at a glance: Work Progress, Trust, and Chaos Level. You can now see the direct impact of every choice you make in real tim","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T14:25:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396620","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024830-1844115010488901","game_id":"steam-5024830","kind":"announcement","title":"\"One Week Left\" Playable Demo is Now Available!","summary":"Hello everyone! I am Yongdustudio, a solo indie developer.The first official playable demo for \"One Week Left\" is finally live on Steam!In this demo, you can experience the first two days of the story (around 15–20 minutes of playtime). Step into the shoes of someone facing their final week at work and make your first crucial choices.Estimated Playtime: ~15–20 minutesSupported Languages: English, Korean, JapaneseRoadmap & Upcoming Updates:As a solo development project, there may still be minor b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T11:55:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488901","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5024830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5024830":"2026-10-25T22:13:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5024830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5194110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5024830","app_id":5024830,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7b05de2bd46a104f7aac4ed2647492431532f62dec842f04fe24f7ea3be81766","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"퇴사까지 남은 시간은 단 5일. 퇴사를 앞둔 주인공이 되어 하루 동안의 일정을 